(function() {
            P.when('cr-A', 'ready').execute(function(A) {
                if(typeof A.toggleExpanderAriaLabel === 'function') {
                    A.toggleExpanderAriaLabel('review_text_read_more', 'Read more of this review', 'Read less of this review');
                }
            });
        })();


        .review-text-read-more-expander:focus-visible {
            outline: 2px solid #2162a1;
            outline-offset: 2px;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }











    Purchased it for my Son's birthday. He is certainly happy to have added yet another one to his collection of watches. Look wise it is out of box. It goes well with the young generation. But after four months when I'm writing this review he is complaining of a small white fungus type of patch developing from a corner. Let me see how it goes.

